            "is_free": false,
            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/612040/extras/4c8d02eee3a5ae0e20bceccc7e47ff0f.avif?t=1618454185\" width=600 height=204 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/612040/extras/b0790e7957c4d4e8a37cfc51d30cfddd.webp?t=1618454185\" width=600 height=48 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AHOY THERE!</strong></h2><br><br>Duel on Board is a 1 vs 1 local multiplayer competitive / party game where pirates fight for the precious beer while sailing the dangerous high seas. Just like old school games, you can play with your friend on the same keyboard!<br><br>These are the rules of the duel:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Reach the center of the ship where the beer is placed.<br></li><li>Don't get thrown off the ship.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/612040/extras/8822368bb68821fd0646feadb93f4df8.avif?t=1618454185\" width=600 height=204 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/612040/extras/9a338bfeca9adc8776b337540ef1b07f.webp?t=1618454185\" width=600 height=48 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY ONLINE WITH A FRIEND WITH  REMOTE PLAY</strong></h2><br><br>With Steam's newest Remote Play feature, it's never been easier to play a local multiplayer game with a friend. With this new feature there's no need to leave your house to play together!<br>  <br>Only one of you needs to have the game!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/612040/extras/ea56fee7e1fa8297140a11c08774d601.avif?t=1618454185\" width=600 height=204 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/612040/extras/574e7cd4e66f31f796af19c623279105.avif?t=1618454185\" width=600 height=108 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JUST LIKE OLD SCHOOL GAMES!</strong></h2><br><br>Two players can play on the same keyboard, so no additional controllers are required!<br><br>Got an AZERTY keyboard? Have a broken key? <br>No problem! There will always be the possibility to change them with the rebinding system.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/612040/extras/a94cf3e346f425b15b7111a5a17a36fa.avif?t=1618454185\" width=600 height=204 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/612040/extras/7120da284f1454822f2a572c2a8bc575.webp?t=1618454185\" width=600 height=48 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BEWARE!</strong></h2><br><br>While sailing the dangerous high seas, you will encounter various locations with events that will change the mechanics and the rules of the game.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Thunderstorm:</strong> Heavy storm ahead! Thunders will strike the ship, use your reflexes to avoid getting stunned by the shockwave.<br></li><li> <strong>Haunted Seas:</strong> Enter a spooky dimension! A ship graveyard will be the place for epic sword duels between players and ghost pirates.<br></li><li> <strong>UFO Attack:</strong> They are coming, watch out! Don't let them abduct you while fighting the other pirate.<br></li><li> <strong>Blizzard:</strong> You are now entering the South Pole and everything is starting to freeze! Be sure to dodge the bullets to avoid getting frozen.</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/612040/extras/f4d08a28b717feba270a3a286e9f3127.avif?t=1618454185\" width=600 height=204 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/612040/extras/7e76f82d53576b863e8072889816ce2c.webp?t=1618454185\" width=600 height=48 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOT EVERYTHING IS ABOUT THE BEER!</strong></h2><br><br>When pirates are not dueling for the beer, they can enjoy some extracurricular activities.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Penalties:</strong> Soccer on a pirate ship! Pirates will take turns to try to score a goal and win the championship.<br></li><li> <strong>Sword Fight:</strong> Don't become shark food! Use your reflexes to push your way through the ship and throw your opponent off the plank.<br></li><li> <strong>Ping Pong:</strong> Jumping is not allowed! Become the master of Ping Pong deflecting all the balls that are coming to you.<br></li><li> <strong>Cannon Dance:</strong> We are under attack! Help each other in order to survive the attack from an enemy ship.</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/612040/extras/4c8d02eee3a5ae0e20bceccc7e47ff0f.avif?t=1618454185\" width=600 height=204 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/612040/extras/b0790e7957c4d4e8a37cfc51d30cfddd.webp?t=1618454185\" width=600 height=48 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AHOY THERE!</strong></h2><br><br>Duel on Board is a 1 vs 1 local multiplayer competitive / party game where pirates fight for the precious beer while sailing the dangerous high seas. Just like old school games, you can play with your friend on the same keyboard!<br><br>These are the rules of the duel:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Reach the center of the ship where the beer is placed.<br></li><li>Don't get thrown off the ship.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/612040/extras/8822368bb68821fd0646feadb93f4df8.avif?t=1618454185\" width=600 height=204 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/612040/extras/9a338bfeca9adc8776b337540ef1b07f.webp?t=1618454185\" width=600 height=48 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY ONLINE WITH A FRIEND WITH  REMOTE PLAY</strong></h2><br><br>With Steam's newest Remote Play feature, it's never been easier to play a local multiplayer game with a friend. With this new feature there's no need to leave your house to play together!<br>  <br>Only one of you needs to have the game!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/612040/extras/ea56fee7e1fa8297140a11c08774d601.avif?t=1618454185\" width=600 height=204 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img